(3, 'Tipo de cuenta', 'tipo-de-cuenta', '<section class=\"pc-section\"><div class=\"pc-inner\"><p class=\"pc-description text-base leading-loose text-justify\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nulla tincidunt nisi eu pellentesque fringilla. Proin tincidunt, dolor vitae pellentesque scelerisque, sapien augue lobortis orci, quis blandit magna enim a magna. Duis feugiat eros magna, at fermentum velit interdum non. Vestibulum rhoncus sagittis lorem, eu placerat sem pellentesque et. Phasellus ac mauris pulvinar, fringilla neque quis, mollis sapien.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4\"><span class=\"pc-eyebrow text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-wide\">¡Invierte con propósito!</span><h2 class=\"pc-title text-4xl font-bold leading-tight\">Invierte desde</h2><span class=\"pc-price font-extrabold\">$150.00</span><a href=\"#\" class=\"pc-btn inline-block px-10 py-4 text-white text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-wider no-underline rounded-lg\">Adquiere tu cuenta</a></div></div></section><section class=\"ci-section\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-5\"><div class=\"ci-item__icon w-14 h-14 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><i class=\"ri-phone-fill ci-item__icon-i\"></i></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><span class=\"ci-item__label text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-wide\">Contáctenos</span><a href=\"tel:+50322506090\" class=\"ci-item__value text-base no-underline transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-75\">(503)-2250-6090</a></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-5\"><div class=\"ci-item__icon w-14 h-14 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><i class=\"ri-mail-fill ci-item__icon-i\"></i></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><span class=\"ci-item__label text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-wide\">Correo</span><a href=\"mailto:servicio.cliente@bancointegral.com\" class=\"ci-item__value text-base no-underline transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-75\">servicio.cliente@bancointegral.com</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"il-section w-full px-16 py-14 bg-white\"><div class=\"il-bg\"><img src=\"https://demo.web-informatica.info/adminintegral/public/images/brand-logo.png\" alt=\"\"/></div><div class=\"il-grid relative z-10 grid gap-8\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"il-item flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/d49c9761-dcf7-4321-944f-f6c590ed750b.svg\" alt=\"Credito inversion\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"il-item__label text-lg font-semibold leading-snug\">Créditos de inversión</span></a><a href=\"#\" class=\"il-item flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/4026592d-ec47-4d2d-b98b-4adef15e3b52.svg\" alt=\"Credito vivienda\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"il-item__label text-lg font-semibold leading-snug\">Créditos de vivienda</span></a><a href=\"#\" class=\"il-item flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/0f931585-e419-4096-92dc-d9febf582206.svg\" alt=\"Ahorros y depositos\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"il-item__label text-lg font-semibold leading-snug\">Ahorros y depósitos a plazos</span></a><a href=\"#\" class=\"il-item flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/206d4b04-b5e2-4c32-9a4d-0bb85ebe2b2b.svg\" alt=\"Microseguros\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"il-item__label text-lg font-semibold leading-snug\">Microseguros</span></a></div></section>', '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}.pc-section{width:100%;padding-top:4rem;padding-r