(8, 'Crediverde', 'crediverde', '<div data-gjs-type=\"hero-banner-component\" data-hero-banner-config=\"{&quot;bg_image&quot;:&quot;/storage/media/images/d61bb78a-e2ea-4ce0-8878-ae5d3a61af5b.webp&quot;,&quot;bg_position_x&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;bg_position_y&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;theme&quot;:&quot;blue&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;CREDIVERDE&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;Haz crecer tu negocio con eficiencia energética&quot;}\" id=\"i9zibq\"><section id=\"hb-root-hbsscpz\" class=\"hb-section\"><div class=\"hb-bg\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/d61bb78a-e2ea-4ce0-8878-ae5d3a61af5b.webp\" alt=\"CREDIVERDE\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" draggable=\"false\" class=\"hb-pos-center-center\"/></div><div class=\"hb-content\"><div class=\"hb-box\"><div class=\"hb-box-inner\"><span class=\"hb-badge\" id=\"i0cjia\">CREDIVERDE</span><p class=\"hb-subtitle\">Haz crecer tu negocio con eficiencia energética</p></div></div></div><div class=\"hb-curve\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1366 230\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M1366 0C1073.5 102.496 725.5 165.891 0 165.891V230H1366V0Z\" fill=\"#003B71\"></path><path d=\"M1366 0C1073.5 102.496 725.5 165.891 -20 165.891\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E97300\" stroke-width=\"4\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></path></svg></div></section></div><section class=\"w-full bg-white px-16 py-12\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#E97300] shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-[#E97300] uppercase tracking-wide\">Financiamiento<br/></span></div><p class=\"text-[#003B71] leading-snug m-0 text-base\">Disponible para las siguientes inversiones: <br/></p><div class=\"fc-cards-grid\"><div class=\"fc-card flex flex-col items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-6\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#E97300] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/8dda8231-6296-4b2f-a383-8ef276ee3c8f.svg\" alt=\"Bombillo\" class=\"w-10 h-10 object-contain\"/></div><p class=\"text-base text-[#003B71] text-center leading-relaxed m-0\">Compra de equipos: luminarias, paneles solares, calentadores, refrigeradores, congeladores u otros</p></div><div class=\"fc-card flex flex-col items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-6\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#E97300] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/6cc79f2a-2538-403d-a9ad-e8090c7b0f27.svg\" alt=\"Electricidad\" class=\"w-10 h-10 object-contain\"/></div><p class=\"text-base text-[#003B71] text-center leading-relaxed m-0\">Equipos que mejoren el consumo eléctrico del hogar o negocio</p></div><div class=\"fc-card flex flex-col items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-6\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#E97300] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/74f5c55e-ec6c-491b-954b-4adb234a17bd.svg\" alt=\"Engranajes\" class=\"w-10 h-10 object-contain\"/></div><p class=\"text-base text-[#003B71] text-center leading-relaxed m-0\">Compra de motores eficientes para producción y fabricación (textiles, panaderías, etc)</p></div><div class=\"fc-card flex flex-col items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-6\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#E97300] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/ad13c8ca-899f-4dfd-8cdd-ba542f0c8412.svg\" alt=\"Intercambio\" class=\"w-10 h-10 object-contain\"/></div><p class=\"text-base text-[#003B71] text-center leading-relaxed m-0\">Cualquier otro tipo equipo o activo, que genere un ahorro o eficiencia en el ciclo productivo del negocio del cliente</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"w-full bg-white px-16 py-12\"><div class=\"pd-three-col-grid\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-[#E97300] uppercase tracking-wide\">CONDICIONES:<br/></span><ul class=\"list-none p-0 m-0 flex flex-col gap-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"iqar01\">Monto a financiar según perfil del cliente.*<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"ir0pyu\">Hasta 7 años plazo.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"i6dexi\">Frecuencia de pago mensual.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"ilxj2f\">Tasa especial.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"iw9wzl\">Seguro de vehículo.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"ijuyxh\">Microseguro de salud opcional.*<br/></span></li></ul></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-[#E97300] uppercase tracking-wide\">Beneficios:</span><ul class=\"list-none p-0 m-0 flex flex-col gap-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"ii4312\">Adquiere un activo productivo para tu negocio.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"ifk41m\">Cuida el medio ambiente con menor contaminación o certificaciones que eleven el nivel competitivo de las Micro y Pequeñas Empresas.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"i1wbxw\">Acceso a formación empresarial.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"itp0wj\">Garantías: de acuerdo con el monto y tipo de inversión a financiar.<br/></span></li></ul></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-black text-[#E97300] uppercase leading-tight text-center w-full\">CREDIVERDE</h2><a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-block py-3 px-8 rounded-full pd-btn-orange text-white text-base font-bold text-center uppercase tracking-wide max-w-full transition-colors no-underline\">SOLICITA TU CRÉDITO</a><div class=\"w-full flex flex-col gap-2 pt-3\"><ul class=\"list-none p-0 m-0 flex flex-col gap-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1 h-1 rounded-full pd-dot-muted shrink-0\"></span><p class=\"text-sm pd-text-muted leading-relaxed text-justify m-0\">Restricciones aplican. Monto, requisitos y tasa de interés según políticas de créditos y tarifario vigente. <br/></p></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1 h-1 rounded-full pd-dot-muted shrink-0\"></span><p class=\"text-sm pd-text-muted leading-relaxed text-justify m-0\">Más información en agencias.<br/></p></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"il-section\"><div class=\"il-grid\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline il-link-item\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 il-icon-badge\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/3cb6ef73-5607-4812-b222-64ce630bba9e.svg\" alt=\"Cuenta ahorro\" class=\"w-8 h-8 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-snug il-link-label transition-colors duration-200\">Cuenta de ahorro<