(18, 'Crediestacional', 'crediestacional', '<div data-gjs-type=\"hero-banner-component\" data-hero-banner-config=\"{&quot;bg_image&quot;:&quot;/storage/media/images/c622bd27-8caa-4afc-9b22-189ad3de0443.webp&quot;,&quot;theme&quot;:&quot;blue&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;CREDIESTACIONAL&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;Temporadas&quot;}\" id=\"imhpf3\"><section id=\"hb-root-hbn7cmx\" class=\"hb-section\"><div class=\"hb-bg\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/c622bd27-8caa-4afc-9b22-189ad3de0443.webp\" alt=\"CREDIESTACIONAL\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" draggable=\"false\"/></div><div class=\"hb-content\"><div class=\"hb-box\"><div class=\"hb-box-inner\"><span class=\"hb-badge\" id=\"i976zh\">CREDIESTACIONAL</span><p class=\"hb-subtitle\">Temporadas</p></div></div></div><div class=\"hb-curve\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1366 230\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M1366 0C1073.5 102.496 725.5 165.891 0 165.891V230H1366V0Z\" fill=\"#003B71\"></path><path d=\"M1366 0C1073.5 102.496 725.5 165.891 -20 165.891\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E97300\" stroke-width=\"4\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></path></svg></div></section></div><section class=\"w-full bg-white px-16 py-12\"><div class=\"pd-header-grid\"><div class=\"pd-hg-intro\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#003B71] leading-snug m-0\">Impulsa tu negocio cuando más lo necesites. Con Crediestacional cuentas con financiamiento oportuno para aprovechar oportunidades de inversión, fortalecer tus operaciones y seguir creciendo.\n        </p></div><div class=\"pd-hg-col1 flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-[#E97300] uppercase tracking-wide\">Ventajas</span><ul class=\"list-none p-0 m-0 flex flex-col gap-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"i8jztd\">Trámite rápido y sin tanto requisito.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"iemqj5\">Atención personalizada en el lugar de negocio.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"igs3i5\">Oportunidad de inversión inmediata.<br/></span></li></ul></div><div class=\"pd-hg-col2 flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-[#E97300] uppercase tracking-wide\">CONDICIONES<br/></span><ul class=\"list-none p-0 m-0 flex flex-col gap-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"ivry11\">Presentar un buen historial crediticio.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"ioe0de\">Plazos hasta 6 meses.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"iflxfb\">Tener un crédito vigente con Banco Integral.<br/></span></li></ul></div><div class=\"pd-hg-action flex flex-col items-center gap-4\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-black text-[#E97300] break-words uppercase leading-tight text-center w-full\">CREDIESTACIONAL\n        </h2><a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-block py-3 px-8 rounded-full pd-btn-orange text-white text-base font-bold text-center uppercase tracking-wide max-w-full transition-colors no-underline\">Adquiere tu cuenta</a><div class=\"w-full flex flex-col gap-2 pt-3\"><p class=\"text-sm pd-text-muted leading-relaxed text-justify m-0\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.\n          </p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"il-section\"><div class=\"il-grid\"><a hr