(19, 'Credicasa', 'credicasa', '<div data-gjs-type=\"hero-banner-component\" data-hero-banner-config=\"{&quot;bg_image&quot;:&quot;/storage/media/images/1e57c452-6578-4cb6-aede-dd2b74054ffe.webp&quot;,&quot;bg_position_x&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;bg_position_y&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;theme&quot;:&quot;blue&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;CREDICASA&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;Adquiere o mejora tu hogar&quot;}\" id=\"icwod4\"><section id=\"hb-root-hblli5i\" class=\"hb-section\"><div class=\"hb-bg\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/1e57c452-6578-4cb6-aede-dd2b74054ffe.webp\" alt=\"CREDICASA\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" draggable=\"false\" class=\"hb-pos-center-center\"/></div><div class=\"hb-content\"><div class=\"hb-box\"><div class=\"hb-box-inner\"><span class=\"hb-badge\" id=\"iw5qed\">CREDICASA</span><p class=\"hb-subtitle\">Adquiere o mejora tu hogar</p></div></div></div><div class=\"hb-curve\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1366 230\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M1366 0C1073.5 102.496 725.5 165.891 0 165.891V230H1366V0Z\" fill=\"#003B71\"></path><path d=\"M1366 0C1073.5 102.496 725.5 165.891 -20 165.891\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E97300\" stroke-width=\"4\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></path></svg></div></section></div><section class=\"w-full bg-white px-16 py-12\"><div class=\"pd-asymmetric-grid\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#003B71] leading-snug\">Tu hogar y tu negocio merecen crecer contigo. <br/>Con Credicasa puedes adquirir, construir o mejorar tu propiedad, realizar ampliaciones, remodelaciones y otras mejoras que te ayuden a disfrutar de un espacio más cómodo, seguro y preparado para el futuro.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-[#E97300] uppercase tracking-wide\">CONDICIONES<br/></span><ul class=\"list-none p-0 m-0 flex flex-col gap-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"i5jlb9\">Compra de vivienda nueva o usada, hasta el 90% del precio de venta.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"i5ynqy\">Mejoras o instalaciones del servicio de agua y/o Energía.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"iz8g31\">Construcción.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"ifmph2\">Remodelación.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"i6m1mu\">Ampliación.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"ifzs1a\">Reparación.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"is4z9a\">Acceso a formación empresarial.<br/></span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-black text-[#E97300] uppercase leading-tight text-center w-full\">CREDICASA</h2><a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-block py-3 px-8 rounded-full pd-btn-orange text-white text-base font-bold text-center uppercase tracking-wide max-w-full transition-colors no-underline\">SOLICITA TU CRÉDITO</a><div class=\"w-full flex flex-col gap-2 pt-3\"><p class=\"text-sm pd-text-muted leading-relaxed text-justify m-0\">*Asistencia Técnica Constructiva GRATIS<br/></p><p class=\"text-sm pd-text-muted leading-relaxed text-justify m-0\">*Restricciones aplican. Más información agencias.<br/></p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"il-section\"><div class=\"il-grid\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline il-link-item\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 il-icon-badge\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/3cb6ef73-5607-4812-b222-64ce630bba9e.svg\" alt=\"Cuenta ahorro\" class=\"w-8 h-8 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-snug il-link-label transition-colors duration-200\">Cuenta de ahorro</span></a><a href=\"#\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline il-link-item\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 il-icon-badge\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/ff1c5ad6-0fad-4c6c-878e-20fbd2db7bb0.svg\" alt=\"Ahorro rentable\" class=\"w-8 h-8 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-snug il-link-label transition-colors duration-200\">Ahorro rentable</span></a><a href=\"#\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline il-link-item\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 il-icon-badge\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/ae2c56c6-28c5-4946-869c-53255be75b37.svg\" alt=\"Deposito plazo\" class=\"w-8 h-8 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-snug il-link-label transition-colors duration-200\">Ahorros y depósitos a plazos</span></a><a href=\"#\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline il-link-item\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 il-icon-badge\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/c8473273-0942-4eea-9e7e-c533d219ed4e.svg\" alt=\"Tasas y comisiones\" class=\"w-8 h-8 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-snug il-link-label transition-colors duration-200\">Tasas y comisiones</span></a></div></section><section class=\"ci-section\"><div cla