text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"ilwkt\">Con o sin experiencia crediticia.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"ioed4\">Crédito para Gastos personales o Compra de vehículo de uso personal.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"ioed4-2\">Aplican micro y pequeños empresarios que desean Gastos Personales.</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-black text-[#E97300] uppercase leading-tight text-center w-full\">CREDI EFECTIVO\n        </h2><a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-block py-3 px-8 rounded-full pd-btn-orange text-white text-base font-bold text-center uppercase tracking-wide max-w-full transition-colors no-underline\">SOLICITA TU CRÉDITO</a><div class=\"w-full rounded-xl border-2 pd-box-border px-6 py-4 flex gap-1 text-center flex-row items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold pd-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide\">HASTA:</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-black pd-text-orange\">$25,000.00*</span></div><div class=\"w-full flex flex-col gap-2 pt-3\"><p class=\"text-sm pd-text-muted leading-relaxed text-justify m-0\">*Restricciones aplican. Orden de descuento, análisis de crédito. Monto hasta $25,000 dólares sujeto a nivel de ingresos.\n            <br/></p><p class=\"text-sm pd-text-muted leading-relaxed text-justify m-0\">*Requisitos según política de créditos vigente. Mayor información consultar en nuestras agencias.\n            <br/></p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"il-section\"><div class=\"il-grid\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline il-link-item\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-ce