(26, 'Ahorro programado', 'ahorro-programado', '<div data-gjs-type=\"hero-banner-component\" data-hero-banner-config=\"{&quot;bg_image&quot;:&quot;/storage/media/images/56ac0926-ccf6-4668-a380-d469d964a954.webp&quot;,&quot;bg_position_x&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;bg_position_y&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;theme&quot;:&quot;orange&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;CUENTA DE AHORRO PROGRAMADO&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;Tus metas comienzan con un plan&quot;}\" id=\"it7yno\"><section id=\"hb-root-hb1o6pg\" class=\"hb-section\"><div class=\"hb-bg\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/56ac0926-ccf6-4668-a380-d469d964a954.webp\" alt=\"CUENTA DE AHORRO PROGRAMADO\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" draggable=\"false\" class=\"hb-pos-center-center\"/></div><div class=\"hb-content\"><div class=\"hb-box\"><div class=\"hb-box-inner\"><span class=\"hb-badge\" id=\"i3b0ej\">CUENTA DE AHORRO PROGRAMADO</span><p class=\"hb-subtitle\">Tus metas comienzan con un plan</p></div></div></div><div class=\"hb-curve\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1366 230\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M1366 0C1073.5 102.496 725.5 165.891 0 165.891V230H1366V0Z\" fill=\"#E97300\"></path><path d=\"M1366 0C1073.5 102.496 725.5 165.891 -20 165.891\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#003B71\" stroke-width=\"4\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></path></svg></div></section></div><section class=\"w-full bg-white px-16 py-12\"><div class=\"pd-asymmetric-grid\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#003B71] leading-snug\">Ahorra con propósito y convierte tus metas en logros. Un plan sencillo para construir el futuro que imaginas, paso a paso.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-[#E97300] uppercase tracking-wide\">VENTAJAS</span><ul class=\"list-none p-0 m-0 flex flex-col gap-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"i28a8\">Tasa de interés con alto rendimiento.*<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"ilwkt\">Monto de apertura desde $10.00.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"ioed4\">Plazos convenientes hasta 36 meses (renovable).<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"ioed4-2\">Envío de estado de cuenta por e-mail.<br/></span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-black text-[#E97300] uppercase leading-tight text-center w-full\">aHORRO PROGRAMADO</h2><a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-block py-3 px-8 rounded-full pd-btn-orange text-white text-base font-bold text-center uppercase tracking-wide max-w-full transition-colors no-underline\">Abre tu cuenta aquí</a><div class=\"w-full rounded-xl border-2 pd-box-border px-6 py-4 flex gap-1 text-center flex-row items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold pd-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide\">Monto de apertura:</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-black pd-text-orange\">$10.00*</span></div><div class=\"w-full flex flex-col gap-2 pt-3\"><p class=\"text-sm pd-text-muted leading-relaxed text-justify m-0\">Supervisados por la Superintendencia del Sistema Financiero (SSF). Miembros del Instituto de Garantía de Depósito (IGD).<br/></p><p class=\"text-sm pd-text-muted leading-relaxed text-justify m-0\">*Restricciones Aplican. Tasa de interés anual puede variar, según tarifario vigente, intereses calculados sobre saldos diarios.<br/></p><p class=\"text-sm pd-text-muted leading-relaxed text-justify m-0\">Todos los productos del ahorro cuentan con la certificacion d