(44, 'Colecturía y pagos', 'colecturia-y-pagos', '<div data-gjs-type=\"hero-banner-component\" data-hero-banner-config=\"{&quot;bg_image&quot;:&quot;/storage/media/images/31e6959f-1f15-418d-b39d-e4e49bcae031.webp&quot;,&quot;bg_position_x&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;bg_position_y&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;theme&quot;:&quot;transparent&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;COLECTURÍA Y PAGOS&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\" id=\"i54gg\"><section id=\"hb-root-hby5rtg\" class=\"hb-section\"><div class=\"hb-bg\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/31e6959f-1f15-418d-b39d-e4e49bcae031.webp\" alt=\"COLECTURÍA Y PAGOS\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" draggable=\"false\" class=\"hb-pos-center-center\"/></div><div class=\"hb-content\"><div class=\"hb-box\"><div class=\"hb-box-inner\"><span class=\"hb-badge\" id=\"iwuau\">COLECTURÍA Y PAGOS</span></div></div></div><div class=\"hb-curve\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1366 230\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M1366 0C1073.5 102.496 725.5 165.891 0 165.891V230H1366V0Z\" fill=\"rgba(0,59,113,0.55)\"></path><path d=\"M1366 0C1073.5 102.496 725.5 165.891 -20 165.891\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E97300\" stroke-width=\"4\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></path></svg></div></section></div><section class=\"w-full bg-white px-16 py-12 flex flex-col gap-8\"><p class=\"text-base text-[#003B71] leading-relaxed m-0\">Puedes pagar tus facturas, recibos y recargas de celular, en nuestras 27 agencias y más de 1000 puntos de pago distribuidos en todo el país, gracias a nuestro eficiente servicio de colecturía.</p><div class=\"pd-icons-cta-grid\"><div class=\"w-full\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/edeb4c3a-4aa8-4804-bded-da558b3f610e.png\" alt=\"Colecturia\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-contain\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-black text-[#E97300] uppercase leading-tight text-center w-full break-words\">Colecturía y Pagos</h2><a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-block py-3 px-8 rounded-full pd-btn-orange text-white text-base font-bold text-center uppercase tracking-wide max-w-full transition-colors no-underline\">Adquiere tu servicio</a></div></div><p class=\"text-base text-[#003B71] leading-relaxed m-0\">Para tu comodidad, también puedes realizar los pagos de tus créditos en la red Puntoxpress y Akí Pago, abierto en horarios extendidos, los 7 días de la semana.</p></section><section class=\"il-section\"><div class=\"il-grid\"><a href=\"/bancaintegral/cuenta-de-ahorro\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline il-link-item\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 il-icon-badge\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/3cb6ef73-5607-4812-b222-64ce630bba9e.svg\" alt=\"Cuenta ahorro\" class=\"w-8 h-8 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-snug il-link-label transition-colors duration-200\">Cuenta de ahorro</span></a><a href=\"/bancaintegral/ahorro-rentable\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline il-link-item\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 il-icon-badge\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/ff1c5ad6-0fad-4c6c-878e-20fbd2db7bb0.svg\" alt=\"Ahorro rentable\" class=\"w-8 h-8 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-snug il-link-label transition-colors duration-200\">Ahorro rentable</span></a><a href=\"#\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline il-link-item\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 il-icon-badge\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/ae2c56c6-28c5-4946-869c-53255be75b37.svg\" alt=\"Deposito plazo\" class=\"w-8 h-8 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-snug il-link-label transition-colors duration-200\">Ahorros y depósitos a plazos</span></a><a href=\"/bancaintegral/tasas-y-comisiones\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline il-link-item\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 il-icon-badge\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/c8473273-0942-4eea-9e7e-c533d219ed4e.svg\" alt=\"Tasas y comisiones\" class=\"w-8 h-8 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-snug il-link-label transition-colors duration-200\">Tasas y comisiones</span></a></div></section><section class=\"ci-section\"><div class=\"ci-row-wrap\"><div class=\"ci-pill-row\"><div class=\"ci-item\"><i class=\"ri-phone-fill ci-icon\"></i><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#003B71]\">Contáctenos</span><a href=\"tel:+50322506090\" class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-[#E97300] no-underline hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity\">(503)-2250-6090</a></div></div><div class=\"ci-divider\"></div><div class=\"ci-item\"><i class=\"ri-mail-fill ci-icon\"></i><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#003B71]\">Correo</span><a href=\"mailto:servicio.cliente@bancointegral.com\" class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-[#E97300] no-underline hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity\">servicio.cliente@bancointegral.com</a></div></div></div></div></section>', '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}.il-section{width:100%;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);background-position-x:0%;background-position-y:0%;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;background-image:none;background-size:auto;background-origin:padding-box;background-clip:border-box;padding-top:3.5rem;padding-right:4rem;padding-bottom:3.5rem;padding-left:4rem;}.il-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4, 1fr);display:grid;row-gap:2rem;column-gap:2rem;}.il-item:hover .il-item__label{color:rgb(240, 124, 40);transition-property:color;transition-duration:0.2s;transition-timing-function:ease;transition-delay:0s;transition-behavior:normal;}.pd-three-col-grid