se text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"i4y75\">Cuota flexible y ajustable a tu flujo de efectivo.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"i2nif\">Atención personalizada.<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"i10jo\">Microseguro de salud opcional.**<br/></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-[#003B71]\"><span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#003B71] shrink-0\"></span><span id=\"ixmus\">Acceso a formación empresarial.<br/></span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-black text-[#E97300] break-words uppercase leading-tight text-center w-full\">CAPITAL DE TRABAJO</h2><a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-block py-3 px-8 rounded-full pd-btn-orange text-white text-base font-bold text-center uppercase tracking-wide max-w-full transition-colors no-underline\">SOLICITA TU CRÉDITO</a><div class=\"w-full rounded-xl border-2 pd-box-border px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-1 text-center\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold pd-text-primary uppercase tracking-wide\">HASTA</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-black pd-text-orange\">$40,000*</span></div><div class=\"w-full flex flex-col gap-2 pt-3\"><p class=\"text-sm pd-text-muted leading-relaxed text-justify m-0\">*De $500 a $15,000 sin fiador, de $15,000.01 a $25,000 fiador o prenda de $25,000.01 a $40,000 hipoteca.<br/></p><p class=\"text-sm pd-text-muted leading-relaxed text-justify m-0\">**Restricciones aplican. Retiros ilimitados según cupo de crédito disponible.<br/></p></div></div></div></section>', '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}.hb-section{position:relative;width:100%;padding-top:5rem;padding-right:4rem;padding