(47, 'Multiasistencia', 'multiasistencia', '<div data-gjs-type=\"hero-banner-component\" data-hero-banner-config=\"{&quot;bg_image&quot;:&quot;/storage/media/images/e917d27e-1553-4ec1-85f1-0ec38fb7bedf.webp&quot;,&quot;bg_position_x&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;bg_position_y&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;theme&quot;:&quot;transparent&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;MULTIASISTENCIA HOGAR, MÉDICA Y VIAL&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\" id=\"ix9we2\"><section id=\"hb-root-hbt5elc\" class=\"hb-section\"><div class=\"hb-bg\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/e917d27e-1553-4ec1-85f1-0ec38fb7bedf.webp\" alt=\"MULTIASISTENCIA HOGAR, MÉDICA Y VIAL\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" draggable=\"false\" class=\"hb-pos-center-center\"/></div><div class=\"hb-content\"><div class=\"hb-box\"><div class=\"hb-box-inner\"><span class=\"hb-badge\" id=\"id4gub\">MULTIASISTENCIA HOGAR, MÉDICA Y VIAL</span></div></div></div><div class=\"hb-curve\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1366 230\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M1366 0C1073.5 102.496 725.5 165.891 0 165.891V230H1366V0Z\" fill=\"rgba(0,59,113,0.55)\"></path><path d=\"M1366 0C1073.5 102.496 725.5 165.891 -20 165.891\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E97300\" stroke-width=\"4\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></path></svg></div></section></div><section class=\"w-full bg-white px-16 py-12 flex flex-col gap-5\"><p class=\"text-base font-bold text-[#E97300] m-0\">CUENTAS CON ASISTENCIAS DE:</p><div class=\"pd-cards-row\"><div class=\"pd-card-simple\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 pd-btn-orange\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/b283a38e-5cea-4bc9-b34a-f9c2fb8a3d1e.svg\" alt=\"Icon fontaneria\" class=\"w-7 h-7 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-[#003B71] tracking-wide\">EMERGENCIA DE FONTANERIA<br/></span><p class=\"text-base text-[#003B71] leading-snug m-0\">Servicio inmediato para fgas, tuberías rotas o problemas de plomería.<br/></p></div><div class=\"pd-card-simple\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 pd-btn-orange\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/7258d334-706a-4da3-9325-e163c7aae7ba.svg\" alt=\"Icon casa\" class=\"w-7 h-7 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-[#003B71] tracking-wide\">SERVICIOS DE REFERENCIA Y COORDINACIÓN<br/></span><p class=\"text-base text-[#003B71] leading-snug m-0\">Te ayudamos a encontrar y coordina profesionales de confianza para tus necesidades en casa.<br/></p></div><div class=\"pd-card-simple\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 pd-btn-orange\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/d20c278a-c864-467e-9785-850a05be919b.svg\" alt=\"Icon phonomed\" class=\"w-7 h-7 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-[#003B71] tracking-wide\">PHONOMED 24/7<br/></span><p class=\"text-base text-[#003B71] leading-snug m-0\">Consulta médica telefónica, las 24 horas los 7 días de la semana.<br/></p></div><div class=\"pd-card-simple\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 pd-btn-orange\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/833deca7-b89d-40b7-af3c-0defcc457e0f.svg\" alt=\"Icon nutricional\" class=\"w-7 h-7 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-[#003B71] tracking-wide\">ASISTENCIA NUTRICIONAL<br/></span><p class=\"text-base text-[#003B71] leading-snug m-0\">Consulta con nutricionista en línea para cuidar tu alimentación y salud.<br/></p></div><div class=\"pd-card-simple\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 pd-btn-orange\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/cbd1748f-b435-454d-be86-81910d78e144.svg\" alt=\"Icon grua\" class=\"w-7 h-7 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-[#003B71] tracking-wide\">AUXILIO VIAL<br/></span><p class=\"text-base text-[#003B71] leading-snug m-0\">Cambio de llantas, paso de corriente y suministro de combuste cuando más lo necesites.<br/></p></div></div></section><section class=\"w-full bg-white px-16 pb-12\"><div class=\"pd-asymmetric-grid\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><p class=\"font-bold text-[#003B71] m-0 text-lg\">ASISTENCIA DE HOGAR<br/></p><p class=\"text-base font-normal text-[#003B71] leading-relaxed m-0\">Para imprevistos que pueden complicar tu día, estamos listos para ayudarte con soluciones <span id=\"id1dsb\" class=\"text-[#f0872a]\">rápidas y efectivas.</span><br/></p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><p class=\"font-bold text-[#003B71] m-0 text-lg\">ASISTENCIA MÉDICA<br/></p><p class=\"text-base font-normal text-[#003B71] leading-relaxed m-0\">Porque tu bienestar es <span id=\"ir3o4c\" class=\"text-[#f0872a]\">nuestra prioridad</span>, recuerda que cuentas con servicios de <span id=\"iyradg\" class=\"text-[#f0872a]\">asistencia médica</span> listos para ayudarte en cualquier momento del día.<br/></p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><p class=\"font-bold text-[#003B71] m-0 text-lg\">ASISTENCIA VIAL<br/></p><p class=\"text-base font-normal text-[#003B71] leading-relaxed m-0\">No importa si es de día o de noche, en carretera o en la ciudad, tienes <span id=\"igo375\" class=\"text-[#f0872a]\">apoyo vial para que sigas tu camino sin preocupaciones.</span><br/></p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-black text-[#E97300] break-words leading-tight text-center w-full\">MULTI<br/>ASISTENCIA</h2><a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-block py-3 px-8 rounded-full pd-btn-orange text-white text-base font-bold text-center tracking-wide max-w-full transition-colors no-underline\">ADQUIERE TU SERVICIO</a><div class=\"w-full rounded-xl border-2 pd-box-border px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-1 text-center\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold pd-text-primary tracking-wide\">MONTO DE APERTURA:</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-black pd-text-orange\">$44.08*</span></div><div class=\"w-full flex flex-col gap-2\"><p class=\"pd-text-muted leading-relaxed text-justify m-0 text-sm\">Notificar al número exclusivo de Banco Integral el fallecimiento. <br/></p><p class=\"pd-text-muted leading-relaxed text-justify m-0 text-sm\">Importante hasta 24 hrs después de ocurrido el fallecimiento.<br/></p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"il-section\"><div class=\"il-grid\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline il-link-item\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 il-icon-badge\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/3cb6ef73-5607-4812-b222-64ce630bba9e.svg\" alt=\"Cuenta ahorro\" class=\"w-8 h-8 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-snug il-link-label transition-colors duration-200\">Cuenta de ahorro</span></a><a href=\"#\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline il-link-item\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 il-icon-badge\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/ff1c5ad6-0fad-4c6c-878e-20fbd2db7bb0.svg\" alt=\"Ahorro rentable\" class=\"w-8 h-8 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-snug il-link-label transition-colors duration-200\">Ahorro rentable</span></a><a href=\"#\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline il-link-item\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 il-icon-badge\"><img src=\"/storage/media/images/ae2c56c6-28c5-4946-869c-53255be75b37.svg\" alt=\"Deposito plazo\" class=\"w-8 h-8 object-contain\"/></div><span class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-snug il-link-label transition-colors duration-200\">Ahorros y depósitos a plazos</span></a><a href=\"#\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 no-underline il-link-item\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 il-icon-badge\"